# "Late Night Study" — Lo-Fi Hip Hop
# BeatForge Studio

bpm 78
swing 35
steps 32
kit 808

# Master
reverb 0.35
delay 0.20
enhancer 0.25
width 1.15

# Drums
kick     "x.....x...x.....x.....x...x....."
snare    "....x.......x.+.....x.......x..+"
hh       "x.xox.x.x.xox.x.x.xox.x.x.xox.x."
oh       "..........x...............x....."
rim      "......+.......+.......+.......+."

# Drum mix
vol kick 0.85
vol snare 0.70
vol hh 0.45
vol oh 0.35
vol rim 0.30
pan hh -0.20
pan rim 0.25
lpf hh 5000
dist kick 0.10
sendverb snare 0.25
senddly rim 0.30
sidechain kick hh

# Bass
scale C minor
note "C2 ~ ~ ~ Eb2 ~ ~ ~ G1 ~ ~ ~ Ab1 ~ ~ ~ C2 ~ ~ ~ Eb2 ~ ~ ~ G1 ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~"

# Chords (assign synth on pad 12 → Warm Pad)
chord "Cm7 Fm7 Gm7 Fm7"
